1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,760
Govardhan Puja pe bhagwan ko 56 bhog hi

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:03,470
kyun chadhte hain?

3
00:00:03,490 --> 00:00:05,240
55 ya 60 kyun nahi?

4
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:07,480
Iska jawaab us kahani mein chhupa hai jo

5
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:08,930
aap aadhi hi jaante ho.

6
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:11,570
Braj mein har saal Indra dev ki badi pooja

7
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:12,250
hoti thi.

8
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:14,150
Ek din nanhe Krishna ne poocha:

9
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:16,550
"Baba, hum Indra dev ki pooja kyun karte

10
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:16,930
hain?

11
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,890
Hamari gaayon ko ghaas toh Govardhan

12
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:19,730
parvat deta hai."

13
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:22,030
Logon ne Indra dev ki jagah Govardhan ki

14
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:22,760
pooja ki.

15
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,145
Indra dev naraz ho gaye,

16
00:00:24,165 --> 00:00:26,910
aur Braj pe aisi barish ki ki sab doobne

17
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:27,390
lage.

18
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:29,530
Tab Krishna ne Govardhan parvat apni

19
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:31,160
chhoti ungli pe utha liya.

20
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:33,620
Poora gaon aur saari gaayein uske neeche

21
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:34,460
surakshit.

22
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,250
Aur yahin hai 56 ka jawaab.

23
00:00:36,270 --> 00:00:38,570
Maana jaata hai Krishna ne 7 din tak

24
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:39,770
parvat uthaye rakha,

25
00:00:39,790 --> 00:00:40,820
bina kuch khaaye.

26
00:00:40,850 --> 00:00:42,940
Woh din mein 8 baar bhojan karte the.

27
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:44,220
Toh jab barish ruki,

28
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:46,970
maiya aur Braj ke logon ne 7 din ka khaana

29
00:00:46,990 --> 00:00:48,090
ek saath banaya:

30
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:49,000
56 bhog.

31
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:51,080
Khaane ka woh pahad kehlaya Annakut,

32
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:52,660
yaani anna ka pahad.

33
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:55,190
Aur aaj bhi ghar ke aangan mein gobar se

34
00:00:55,210 --> 00:00:57,310
Govardhan bana ke uski parikrama karte

35
00:00:57,330 --> 00:00:59,660
hain, us parvat ko shukriya kehne ke liye.

36
00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:02,310
Aur isi din, Gujarat apna naya saal manata

37
00:01:02,330 --> 00:01:04,610
hai, aur Maharashtra Raja Bali ko yaad

38
00:01:04,630 --> 00:01:05,310
karta hai.

39
00:01:05,330 --> 00:01:07,110
Toh agli baar 56 bhog dekho,

40
00:01:07,130 --> 00:01:08,200
toh yaad rakhna:

41
00:01:08,220 --> 00:01:10,900
yeh 7 din ke bhookhe Kanha ke liye pyaar

42
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:11,260
hai.

43
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:13,560
Aur aise roz ke "kyun" ke liye Whysplained

44
00:01:13,580 --> 00:01:14,770
ko subscribe karo!
